lanwatch (0.4.3) unstable; urgency=medium

  * LLM: when an answer is not valid JSON, the log now says why the model
    stopped (done_reason), how many tokens went in and out, and how the
    answer ended. A reply cut off mid-way can then be told from a wrong one.
  * Suggestions are made weekly by `lanwatch run`, and the status page has a
    "Run now" button for them. Before, only `lanwatch suggest` made them.

